note Each row builds one player with a single seeded quest state (silently), runs op, and lists in order every server packet (S) and SQL statement (Q) the op caused.
note real=Q001 (quest id 1, quest items 687,688,1079,1080), script=NoblesseTeleporter (id -1, not a real quest). {player} is the player's object id.
note state and vars describe the state afterwards (vars sorted, - when the state left the list); items is the player's count of item 687 afterwards.
